{
  "type": "doc",
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "One user’s access was enough initially. As more teammates do the same work, checking every person’s privileges would become increasingly cumbersome."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I created an order-analysis team in QueryPie, defined its read-only access, then added a new analyst. I checked whether group membership alone enabled order queries."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. Creating an Order-Analysis Group"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Under General → User Management → Groups, I created Orders Lab - Analysts for a fictional team checking order status."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I also prepared Demo Analyst without direct database access, to isolate the effect of group membership."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/group-permissions/01.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 1. Group created for order analysts.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 1. Group created for order analysts."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. Defining the Team’s Required Privileges"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "In Databases → DB Access Control → Access Control, I selected the group and granted Read-Only on Orders Control Lab."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Analysis starts with reads. I granted only what the team needed rather than modification privileges too."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/group-permissions/02.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 2. Granting Read-Only on the lab database to the analysis group.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 2. Granting Read-Only on the lab database to the analysis group."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "After saving, the group’s access list showed Orders Control Lab and Read-Only, making its database and privileges clear."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/group-permissions/03.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 3. Reviewing database connections and privileges by group.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 3. Reviewing database connections and privileges by group."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. Before Joining, No Database Was Available"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I signed in as Demo Analyst before adding it to the group. Databases displayed "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold"
            }
          ],
          "text": "There are no available connections!"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ". Creating an account alone did not grant database use."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "User registration and work-related database access were separate. I could prepare an account first and assign a team based on responsibilities later."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/group-permissions/04.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 4. No database connections available before group membership.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 4. No database connections available before group membership."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. Adding the Analyst to the Team"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "As administrator, I opened Orders Lab - Analysts, selected Demo Analyst in Add Users, and saved. I did not grant database privileges individually."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/group-permissions/05.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 5. Adding the new analyst to the order-analysis group.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 5. Adding the new analyst to the order-analysis group."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Demo Analyst appeared in the member list. Managing team privileges and membership separately should simplify consistent access for the same work."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/group-permissions/06.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 6. The analyst is registered as a group member.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 6. The analyst is registered as a group member."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. Group Access Allows Reads, Not Changes"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "After signing in again, Demo Analyst could see Orders Control Lab. Connection details showed "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold"
            }
          ],
          "text": "Read-Only (Orders Lab - Analysts)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " as the privilege name."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The user could see not just that access existed, but which group supplied it—useful when explaining why a database is accessible."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/group-permissions/07.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 7. The user view identifies Read-Only inherited from the group.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 7. The user view identifies Read-Only inherited from the group."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I clicked Connect and queried IDs, statuses, and amounts in the web SQL editor."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "codeBlock",
      "attrs": {
        "language": null
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "SELECT order_id, status, total_amount\nFROM orders_control.orders\nORDER BY order_id;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Orders 4001–4003 returned normally. The new analyst could begin working using only the group’s configured privileges."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/group-permissions/08.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 8. The analyst queries three orders using group privileges.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 8. The analyst queries three orders using group privileges."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "To verify read-only enforcement without changing data, I attempted UPDATE with nonexistent order ID -1. QueryPie blocked it with "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold"
            }
          ],
          "text": "No permission to execute UPDATE statement"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " as the error message."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/group-permissions/09.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 9. Reads work, but Read-Only blocks UPDATE.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 9. Reads work, but Read-Only blocks UPDATE."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "6. A Useful Foundation as Teams Grow"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The clearest benefit was a consistent basis for privileges: define the team’s databases and access, then add people responsible for that work."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Adoption requires consistent access management after user numbers grow, not just initial connectivity. Seeing team access in one place, managing members, and checking the source of user privileges stood out."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "One new analyst was enough to understand the team-based operating model. "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold"
            }
          ],
          "text": "Define a group rule that permits necessary reads and prevents changes."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " This should help those expanding QueryPie across an organization."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
